data: {"id": "b8bc48031421481d-thinking-parallel_evidence-2450", "run_id": "b8bc48031421481d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 调查结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 当前状态为 **Pending**，`node: <none>`，`READY 0/1`。\n\n2. **调度失败原因**：Pod 设置了 `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`。集群中 3 个节点（master、node1、node2）的标签中**均不包含 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`** 这一标签。因此调度器返回：\n   ```\n   0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.\n   ```\n\n3. **节点状态**：所有 3 个节点均为 `Ready` 状态，版本 `v1.26.8`，不存在资源不足、NotReady 或 taint 导致的调度问题。\n\n4. **Tolerations**：Pod 仅容忍 `node.kubernete", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 8, "ts_ms": 1788403649877, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

