data: {"id": "b8bc48031421481d-final", "run_id": "b8bc48031421481d", "seq": 2455, "ts_ms": 1788403665448, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod 配置了 nodeSelector {aiops.lab/unavailable: true}，但集群中所有节点均未包含该标签，导致调度器无法找到满足条件的节点，Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-972d4cc6ec23) | `FailedScheduling  0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 证明调度器因节点标签不匹配而明确拒绝了 Pod 的调度请求。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-a1d877be1470) | `PodScheduled` condition is `False`，原因 `Unschedulable`，消息确认 `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。 | 从 Pod 状态层面确认当前 Pod 无法被分配到任何节点。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-15ce4b3dd4f5) | `pod.phase` = `Pending`。 | 确认 Pod 当前所处的异常生命周期阶段。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus (fact-48be760c029e) | `kube_pod_status_phase` 显示 `Pending` 状态值为 `1`。 | 通过监控系统独立确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态，与 K8s 状态一致。 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes (fact-11da8eab9320) | `container.resource_request.memory` = `8Mi`。 | 提供资源申请量的上下文，说明资源请求本身未超出常规极值。 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\nKubernetes 事件与 Pod 状态（编号 1、2、3）共同指向了确切的拒绝原因：节点标签不匹配。Metric 数据（编号 4）独立证实了该 Pod 确实持续卡在 Pending 状态。资源配置数据（编号 5）排除了因资源请求异常导致的调度阻塞可能，进一步锁定问题在于节点选择器逻辑。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了 nodeSelector {aiops.lab/unavailable: true} 而集群节点缺失该标签 → 调度器节点匹配失败 → 触发 FailedScheduling 事件并标记 Pod 为 Unschedulable → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **调度器因节点标签不匹配而无法调度 Pod**（支撑事实：编号 1、2）。\n\nPod 被配置了特定的 `nodeSelector` 要求，但集群现有的 3 个节点均未包含该标签，导致调度器找不到任何满足条件的节点进行分配。这一机制直接导致了调度失败事件（编号 1）的生成以及 Pod 状态长期保持为 Pending（编号 3、4）。虽然日志（Logging）与追踪（Tracing）数据因容器未启动而缺失，但 Kubernetes 的控制平面状态与事件已充分证明了调度失败的根本原因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 59.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 59.8s (Evidence 53.9s, RCA 5.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 95.777, "metrics": {"run_id": "b8bc48031421481d", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 95.76704049110413, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "54%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.16, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 80%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 95767.04049110413, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 86001.50513648987, "tool_calls": 20, "executed_tool_calls": 20, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 20, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 22124.297857284546, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 8807.540893554688}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 26358.136653900146, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 59804.49151992798, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9556.23745918274, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

